# VITE_BACKEND_URL is deliberately NOT set.
#
# src/api/client.ts derives the bridge's address from the browser's own
# location, which is correct because Vite serves this page FROM the Jetson --
# so whatever host reached the UI is the host the bridge is on. That makes the
# UI immune to the Jetson's DHCP lease changing, which it does: this file held
# three different literals on 16 Sep alone (172.20.10.2, 192.168.160.106,
# 10.228.103.105) and every stale one looked identical from the browser -- the
# page loads, then "connecting..." forever.
#
# Set it ONLY if the bridge and the UI genuinely run on different machines:
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://<bridge-host>:8000
